title: milo_post_first_restoration
---
Milo: Look at that. *Look at it.* That building was born again. You did that.
Milo: *(spinning)* I can feel the hum upgrading. It's stronger now. The whole valley felt it.
===

title: milo_react_overlook
---
Milo: Oh. *Oh.* Come stand here, traveler.
Milo: That ridge looks down on the whole valley. From here you can see all the way to where the next zone begins.
Milo: That's where we're going next. Eventually.
===

title: milo_react_root_chamber
---
Milo: Sniffsniff. Something's down there. Below this floor.
Milo: It feels like an old well — but older than wells. A *root chamber*. The Tartarians put one under every major dome.
Milo: When the hum gets strong enough, this room will glow. Cyan, like Lirael.
===

title: milo_react_seventeenth_hour
---
Milo: *(ears flat)*
Milo: The Tartarian day is seventeen hours, traveler. We are almost at hour seventeen.
Milo: Things happen at hour seventeen. Old things.
Milo: Stay close to the dome. The light will eat the shadow for a moment, and you should not blink.
===

title: milo_react_giant_skeleton
---
Milo: *(reverent whisper)*
Milo: There. The buried hand. A giant's bones holding a mercury-ball spire.
Milo: They were real. The giants. They were the first architects. They could lift entire domes with a single song.
Milo: This one — Korath, I think, by the proportions — fell trying to slow the Mud Flood.
===

title: milo_react_75_rs
---
Milo: I can feel it. The zone is shifting.
Milo: *(the colors around you brighten, the music swells)*
Milo: This is what restoration *feels* like. The world is exhaling for the first time in a long time.
===
